Package: cinminai-aicui
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Cin-MinAI/Cin-MinAI>
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-venv, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-vte-2.91, git, bubblewrap,
 cinminai-daemon (>= @RELEASE@)
Description: AICUI, the Cin-MinAI coding workspace
 A simple workspace for coding with AI: the chat history, the project's files,
 the session goals and a real terminal where the coding agent works and asks
 before it changes anything. Every change it makes is kept in a changelog with
 undo. Runs on this computer's own model by default; cloud models can be
 connected too. Open it from the Programming menu or the assistant's sidebar.
